le.\n\nh3. Screenshots\n\nAttached: staging build first, Branko's design (files starting D) after.\n\nRaised from Sasha's staging review, 2026-10-14.\n\n----\n\n*Test case for this design issue:*\n\n* [C590111|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/590111] Display switcher tooltips open above it and never cover the column headers","reporter":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png"},"displayName":"Chris Ward","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57815/comment/78735","id":"78735","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitial